        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅限線上遊玩，且防作弊機制會阻擋 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's online-only, and its anti-cheat doesn't let Wine in on a Mac." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
