    "Its anti-cheat blocks Macs, so online play won't work. Single-player will." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Антычыт не пускае гульню на Mac, таму анлайн не працуе. Адзіночная гульня пойдзе."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Anti-Cheat sperrt Macs aus, online geht also nichts. Einzelspieler funktioniert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su antitrampas bloquea los Mac, así que el online no funcionará. El modo individual sí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Son anti-triche bloque les Mac : le jeu en ligne ne marchera pas. Le solo, si."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il suo anti-cheat blocca i Mac, quindi l'online non funziona. Il single player sì."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
